69: \title{Confidence Transport under Relinearization:\\Guarantees, Conservatism, and Policy Behavior\thanks{OpenAI Codex and Anthropic Claude assisted with manuscript editing, code preparation, and review.}}
70: 
71: % Authors must not appear in the submitted version.  tmlr.sty hides this block
